      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if the next promised milestone is missed is Pioneer Freight Solutions. The exact milestone at risk is the acceptance of the remediation plan for the taxonomy change incident, specifically achieving precision@10 >= 0.8 for facility lookups, entity-link hit rate >= 90%, and grouping false positives <= 5% during the validation window from 2026-05-01 to 2026-05-14. This milestone is part of a remediation plan agreed on 2026-03-18, with backfill and index recomputation scheduled through 2026-04-30, and a shadow index build before that. Failure to meet this milestone risks procurement extending a tactical PoC with the cheaper competitor NoiseGuard, which is positioned as a low-mid pricing tactical noise reduction solution. Pioneer Freight Solutions is running a NoiseGuard PoC and procurement pressure is high, making this milestone critical to retention [art_7373b64fdfdd, art_ac8afb52f2d3, art_e2727db588de].",
