      "answer": "Among the North America West Event Nexus accounts, those dealing with taxonomy/search semantics problems are Arcadia Cloudworks, BlueHarbor Logistics, CedarWind Renewables, HelioFab Systems, Pacific Health Network, and Pioneer Freight Solutions. The accounts facing duplicate-action problems are Helix Assemblies Inc., LedgerBright Analytics, LedgerPeak Software, MedLogix Distribution, Peregrine Logistics Group, and Pioneer Grid Retail LLC. Verification that these are all the North America West Event Nexus accounts is missing from the evidence, but the structured account lookup shows 12 matched and returned accounts, consistent with these two groups combined [art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_3ba29fe1e026, art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_8478ccd5b200, art_2f780acc1f96, art_87b096c2c2d3, art_0927b1cbb7f4, art_f64972a66eeb].",
